      "id": 478634,
      "username": "Syed_Anas",
      "name": "Syed Anas",
      "created_at": "2025-08-22T07:05:42.257Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, first mark Allow Alternative Item checked in item master, then create Item Alternative for both items, then it will allow you to use the alternate item in stock entry.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/item-alternative\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/item-alternative</a></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/0/b00efca73148541de90d0b8267b8884437ac6ea9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b00efca73148541de90d0b8267b8884437ac6ea9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/0/b00efca73148541de90d0b8267b8884437ac6ea9_2_690x278.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"p7u8W4EwYzLk4Xk4mfiPg1GY7qx\" width=\"690\" height=\"278\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/0/b00efca73148541de90d0b8267b8884437ac6ea9_2_690x278.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/0/b00efca73148541de90d0b8267b8884437ac6ea9.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/0/b00efca73148541de90d0b8267b8884437ac6ea9.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">856×345 12.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
